 "summary": "An N-channel enhancement MOSFET built on a trench process, rated 60 V drain to source and 20 A continuous at a 25 °C case, in the TO-252 (DPAK) surface-mount package. On-resistance is 23 mΩ typical (35 mΩ max) with 10 V on the gate and 29 mΩ typical (40 mΩ max) at 4.5 V; the threshold lies between 1 V and 2.5 V. Total gate charge is 25 nC typical at 10 V, and the part is rated for 72 mJ of avalanche energy.",
